stdout:
stderr:
Usage of instrument:
  -apply
    	apply changes explicitly
  -dry-run
    	show intended changes without writing
  -entrypoint string
    	explicit project-relative entrypoint when detection is ambiguous
  -experimental
    	acknowledge experimental deep-mode limitations
  -force
    	replace conflicting Extent instrumentation outputs with exact backup
  -json
    	print JSON output
  -mode string
    	instrumentation mode: zero-code, bootstrap, deep (default "bootstrap")
  -show-diff
    	show a simple generated-file diff where available
  -undo
    	remove generated Extent instrumentation files
